T:Anything Goes
C:Cole Porter, 1934
O:Indiana Jones and the Temple of Doom (1984), opening number
N:Title song of the 1934 musical; sung by Kate Capshaw over the opening
N:credits of the film. Refrain only (AABA, 32 bars), lyrics left out.
N:Melody from the French-horn line of a ragtime MIDI arrangement in C
N:(hamienet.com track 2659), cross-checked against a guitar-book ABC in G
N:(SPUDS tuneswap X:23) and a big-band MIDI (hamienet 352320144290334).
N:The guitar book holds bar 2 of the bridge on B; both MIDIs climb a step
N:there (B C# D D#), which is followed here. Chords from the ragtime
N:piano and bass. "An-y-thing" is played straight, not dotted.
